# Watermelon Margarita

Based on a [Watermelon Mock-a-rita posted by jesskeys](https://www.instagram.com/jesskeys_) (wayback unavailable)

{ rating="3" image="watermelon_margarita.jpg" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

- [ ] 3 oz [Watermelon]{ ing="watermelon" } (strained) (about 3 slices of medium watermelon blended)
- [ ] 3/4 oz [lime juice]{ ing="lime-juice" }
- [ ] 1 oz [tequila]{ ing="tequila" }
- [ ] 1 oz [cointreau]{ ing="cointreau" }
- [ ] pinch of [sugar]{ ing="sugar" }

## Recipe

1. Salt glasses
1. Blend [watermelon]{ ing="watermelon" } into a [juice]{ ing="lime-juice" }
1. In a shaker, measure out the alcohol, [lime juice]{ ing="lime-juice" }, and [watermelon]{ ing="watermelon" } juice
1. Add ice and shake
1. Serve with an ice cube and lime (or [watermelon]{ ing="watermelon" }) garnish
